:: ReadingRoom [karlowe] {"title":"02 / Reading room"}
# Reading room

A silver bookmark crosses the light. This room is written in **Karlowe**; the runtime
does not need to know that.

(display: "Status")

(if: $hasKey)[
  The archivist pushes the final book toward you.

  (link-goto: "Take the key to the vault", "Vault")
](else:)[
  (print: "The northern door is locked. Retrieve the key at the entrance first.")
]

(link-repeat: "Read an unfamiliar passage")[
  (set: $insight to $insight + 1)
]

[[Return to the entrance->Start]]
